 snake turns toward a glowing red food item on a dark grid.","https://twitchcaptain.com/snake/","width",1280,"height",720,"credit","GameMap browser capture","list","attribution","Creator-attributed clients / models (not inferred from related tools)","items",[80],"DeepSeek model","links","Related resources",[86],"resourceIds","section",{"_57":87,"_25":88},"DeepSeek · Agent Integrations","/resources/deepseek-agent-integrations/","Creator evidence",[92],"evidence",{"_57":93,"_25":94,"_95":96},"See the creator’s DeepSeek attribution","https://github.com/TwitchCaptain/snake","note","The author-controlled repository description says the game was created by DeepSeek. This is an attribution, not a reproducible prompt log.","Source contents","complete project","Project source",[101],{"_57":102,"_25":94,"_95":103},"Open the complete Snake project","Complete HTML, CSS, and JavaScript project. Graphics and sound are produced in code; open index.html to play locally.","Access type","playable","demo","Play or run",[109],{"_57":110,"_25":68,"_95":111},"Play Neon Snake","Move with arrows or WASD, pause with Space or Escape, and avoid walls and your tail. Touch controls are implemented in the source.","Game platform","Browser","Guide format","disclosure","tutorial","Build story / tutorial",[119],{"_57":120,"_25":94,"_95":-7},"Read the author’s project disclosure","Study this workflow","ordered",true,[125,126,127,128],"Play a round and observe how eating food advances the level.","Read the repository’s DeepSeek attribution and gameplay instructions.","Inspect the game loop, input queue, food spawning, and collision handling.","Change one level’s parameters and verify start, pause, loss, and restart.","AI workflow / foundation context","The creator’s repository description explicitly credits DeepSeek for creating the game. The README documents play and scoring, but no prompts or generation transcript are published.","aiUse","guidance","Creation category","AI-assisted (creator attribut